0,West Damar language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/West_Damar_language,"West Damar, or North Damar, is an Austronesian language of Damar Island, one of the Maluku Islands of Indonesia. In spite of rather low cognacy rates with its neighboring languages, it can be classified as part of the Babar languages based on qualitative evidence.","Damar, West",Austronesian
